  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1292eab49f07e4bb7b50b1700004478e, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n, m\xE0n ngh\u1EC9: ho\xE0n th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t ph\u1ED1i
    h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1EB9p v\xE0 d\u1EC5 quan s\xE1t; kh\xF4ng th\xEAm h\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng
    ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ED9 ch\xEDnh x\xE1c m\u1EDBi. B\u1ED1 tr\xED: P18 + P23 \u2014
    hai bi tr\xEAn \u0111\xF2n b\u1EA9y d\u1EC5 gi\u1EEF, ch\u1ED1t r\xF5, hai s\xE2n
    tho\xE1t ng\u1EAFn, b\u1ECF l\u1ED3ng v\xE0 c\xFA bay.\nRecovery: C\u1EEDa ra
    r\u1ED9ng, s\xE2n chung l\u1EDBn; l\u1EA5y l\u1EA1i bi gi\u1EEF t\u1EA3i b\u1EB1ng
    m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED9 nghi\xEAng quen thu\u1ED9c"
